SUMMARY:North Surf G2016/17 Royal - Irondale Girls Soccer Annual Youth
  Soccer Clinic
DESCRIPTION:Irondale Girls Soccer is excited to host its annual Youth
  Soccer Clinic for female players in grades 2–5!<br><br>Tuesday\, August
  25<br>6:00–7:30 PM<br>Irondale High School – Turf Field<br>Cost: Free
  - donations accepted<br><br>Come out for a fun evening of soccer with the
  Irondale Girls Soccer program! Players should bring a size 4 soccer
  ball\, water bottle\, and cleats.<br><br>There is no cost to participate.
  Optional donations will be accepted to help support the Irondale Girls
  Soccer team&#39\;s upcoming trip to Duluth.
LOCATION:Irondale High School\, Long Lake Road\, New Brighton\, MN\, USA
STATUS:CONFIRMED
URL:https://app.playmetrics.com
