SUMMARY:North Surf G2016/17 Royal - Mounds View Varsity Girls Ball Chasers 
DESCRIPTION:We have been invited to participate in the Mounds View Girls
  Varsity Soccer Game as Ball Chasers. It&#39\;s a fun experience for the
  girls to be on the field and watch a High School game. They will spread
  out around the field and grab out of bound balls for players. <br><br>If
  they girls could arrive around 4:40ish (I know this is a little tight
  with some schools getting out at 4pm. But we will make it work if you a
  little later too. <br><br>Parents are welcome to stay but please note
  that a ticket is required to get into the stadium to watch. <br><br>I
  will send out more details next week! 
LOCATION:1900 Lake Valentine Road\, Arden Hills\, MN\, USA
STATUS:CONFIRMED
URL:https://app.playmetrics.com
END:VEVENT
