SUMMARY:North Surf G2016/17 Royal - Acceleration Team Training
DESCRIPTION:Acceleration Team Training<br><br>Wear: Tennis/Running Shoes\,
  NSSA Training top &amp\; Black Shorts<br><br>Complete Waiver Here:
  https://acceleration.sites.zenplanner.com/sign-up-now.cfm<br><br>Each
  team member will begin with a thorough\, active warm-up on padded
  flooring in their socks. This allows athletes to better understand and
  feel how the foot and ankle are critical components of efficient movement
  and sport performance.<br><br>Athletes will then rotate through sprinting
  bouts on our incline treadmills while using a mirror for visual feedback.
  Our acceleration trainers break down key sprint mechanics\, including
  foot strike\, knee drive\, chest position\, and arm swing. Variable
  speeds are used for each athlete to ensure that everyone is performing an
  appropriate and consistent amount of work.<br><br>To finish the session\,
  our trainers will assess each athlete&#39\;s maximum sprint speed. Our
  treadmills can reach speeds of up to 28 mph\, allowing athletes to safely
  challenge and measure their top-end speed.<br>We will share information
  on how to continue training at Acceleration during the fall \, winter\,
  and spring months. 
LOCATION:833 3rd Street Southwest\, New Brighton\, MN\, USA
STATUS:CONFIRMED
URL:https://app.playmetrics.com
END:VEVENT
