SUMMARY:North Surf G2016/17 Royal - Fall Tryout Help - NSC Field 25
DESCRIPTION:Hi Everyone\, <br><br>We have our Fall Tryout on October 22nd
  and we could use a few extra players to come out and kick the ball around
  with the players who are trying out. This is an OPTIONAL event but the
  more of you that can attend the better. Please update your availability
  for this event to help us plan. Let me know if you have any questions.
  Wear your blue training top.<br><br>Skylar Schulz <br>U7-U10 Director of
  Coaching<br>North Surf Soccer Academy<br>skylar.schulz@nssasoccer.org
LOCATION:National Sports Center\, 105th Avenue Northeast\, Blaine\, MN\,
  USA
STATUS:CONFIRMED
URL:https://app.playmetrics.com
END:VEVENT
